      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Source of truth: the status enums and transition methods in src/Tms/Norvia.Tms.Domain, and GLOSSARY.md. A transition that\nfails its guard returns false or a refusal and changes nothing. The TMS never closes an Exception: the Planner does, and a\nCause cleared marker does not change its status.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "baseline": 11,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Source of truth: the status enums and transition methods in src/Tms/Norvia.Tms.Domain, and GLOSSARY.md. A transition that\nfails its guard returns false or a refusal and changes nothing. The TMS never closes an Exception: the Planner does, and a\nCause cleared marker does not change its status.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
